What:			/sys/kernel/debug/u100/gpio
Date:			September 2025
KernelVersion:	6.6.77
Contact:		Jingbiao Nan <jingbiao.nan@samsung.com>
Description:	This node provides GPIO control functionalities.
		The following strings will be accepted:
			'poweron'	: U100 power on
			'poweroff'	: U100 power off
			'reset'		: U100 reset
			'syncreset'	: U100 reset and waiting for the ATR
			'ldswon'	: Load switch on
			'ldswoff'	: Load switch off
			'ldswreset'	: Load switch reset (load switch off and on)
